  "description": "Operating Area: Kimberley, Broome, Montebello Islands, Northern Ningaloo Coast, Geographe Bay, Australia\n\nA new way to travel, exploring the beauty of The West Australian coastline with respect and care for land & wildlife.\n\nEclipse is a brand new Leopard 50 sailing catamaran. Eclipse's naval architecture and interior design focus on the beauty of the finer details, creating a luxury small group sailing experience connected to nature. Being a catamaran, Eclipse is spacious with ample comfortable areas for relaxing in private or entertaining.\n\nYOTSPACE is a registered agent of Eclipse",
